  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Jagged rock and high moisture mark the eighth layer as Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan press down past mortal Gu Masters hunting and gathering moss.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the fortieth layer the seal on Star Lord Wan Xiang’s corpse ends; Star Form Blessed Land forms as starlight takes in earth qi. The quake kills many lives while Gu Masters treat it as ordinary seismic hazard.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The eighth layer is dark and gloomy, with sparse light, jagged rocks, high moisture, and a spacious cavern. Earth Abyss is an incomparably large underground world of tens of layers, each at least hundreds of thousands of square kilometers, with caves and tunnels, some like labyrinths, some with giant underground lakes, and some with flat ground. The thirtieth layer is a scene of darkness. The floor of the thirty-sixth layer is nearly ten thousand feet thick.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ancient Soul Sect’s hold on the near layers, and how far explorers later push, come into view.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exploration-depth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ancient Soul Sect keeps its headquarters here and treats the place as exclusive domain, yet has only fully explored eighteen layers, with brief work to the twenty-seventh and Gu Immortals only rarely between the twenty-eighth and thirty-sixth. Hei Lou Lan recalls exploration stopping at thirty-six layers; Fang Yuan says the depth goes further.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exploration-depth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life, beast tides pour from Earth Abyss onto Central Continent, and Ancient Soul Sect takes the first blow. After years of surface fighting, righteous and demonic Gu Masters push into the abyss; past the thirty-sixth layer they find a larger underground world of beast groups, desolate beasts, and ancient desolate beasts. By the time Fang Yuan self-detonates in that life, explorers have found one hundred and seven layers, while Ancient Soul Sect still holds only the thirty-six layers nearest the surface.",
      "chapters": [
        728
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exploration-depth",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_demonic_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earth Abyss holds a secret base of Shadow Sect inside an underground rockman maze, and the rockmen there have already been transferred out.",
      "chapters": [
        1026
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-secret-base",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
